1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,100
This tortoise is 194 years old,

2
00:00:02,120 --> 00:00:05,109
and his DNA just revealed
something strange.

3
00:00:05,349 --> 00:00:07,647
He hatched before the American Civil War.

4
00:00:07,887 --> 00:00:10,369
Scientists found 287 gene variants,

5
00:00:10,389 --> 00:00:13,371
tied to repairing DNA and fighting cancer.

6
00:00:13,611 --> 00:00:14,799
But the real surprise:

7
00:00:14,819 --> 00:00:17,818
parts of his epigenome look as young
as a 5-year-old's.

8
00:00:18,058 --> 00:00:19,906
Getting that DNA took a vet 5 seconds,

9
00:00:19,926 --> 00:00:21,626
a welding glove, and a cotton swab.

10
00:00:21,866 --> 00:00:22,851
Would you want to live that long?

